Elena here! 🎉 Just wrapped up 5,000 stress cycles on my telemetry watchdog module and it passed EVERY. SINGLE. ONE. 🔥🔥🔥

Here's the core loop — the adaptive fallback timeout + hardware timer pet:

```c
while (1) {
    if (telemetry_available()) {
        if (backpressure > HIGH_THRESH) {
            timeout = adaptive_scale(backpressure);
            // skip blocking send, pet watchdog, continue
            pet_hw_timer();
            continue;
        }
        send_telemetry_frame();
    }
    pet_hw_timer();
    delay(timeout);
}
```

